<!-- Authored fresh rather than cloned from Direct3d9.vcxproj on purpose. That
     project leads its x64 include path with the vendored directx9 include
     directory followed by the June 2010 DirectX SDK include directory, and that
     SDK also ships d3d11.h, dxgi.h and d3d11.lib. Inheriting those paths would
     silently bind this backend to D3D11.0 and DXGI 1.1, losing ID3D11Device1
     and IDXGIFactory2, and with them CreateSwapChainForHwnd and the flip model
     swap chain, with no error reported anywhere. This project therefore names
     no legacy DirectX SDK path of any kind: everything it needs comes from the
     Windows SDK.

     Output naming, OutDir, IntDir, PCH and PDB paths are all owned by
     Directory.Build.props and Directory.Build.targets at the repository root.
     They are deliberately absent here.

     x64 only. The three Win32 solution configurations skip this project. -->
